---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('stoneward');
---
<AppLayout app={app} title={`Support · ${app.name}`}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="support" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="Contact" title={`Questions? <em>Write to us.</em>`}>
        <p class="lede">Need help with {app.name}, or want to share feedback? Send an email to <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>. You'll get a reply from Jonas himself, usually within a day.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="02" label="FAQ" title={`What people <em>ask about</em>.`}>
        <p><strong>How do the leaderboards work?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">There are three, all anonymous and powered by Apple CloudKit: an all-time, a weekly and a daily board. When you're signed in to iCloud, your score and highest tier are submitted with an anonymous code. Others see only a masked label like "Climber A8F2K", never your name. Want off the lists? Send an email.</p>
        <p><strong>What is {app.name}+?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">A one-time purchase that removes the ads and unlocks extra features. It follows your Apple ID and can be restored on new devices via "Restore purchases".</p>
        <p><strong>What is Dust?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">The in-app currency. You earn Dust by playing and spend it on upgrades. Want more? You can buy Dust packs.</p>
        <p><strong>How do I remove ads?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">Buy {app.name}+. You can also manage tracking and ad consent within the app and in iOS settings.</p>
        <p><strong>Is my data private?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">Yes. Gameplay data stays on your device, and the leaderboard is anonymous. We don't collect your name, email or Apple ID. See the <a class="tx-link" href="/en/stoneward/personvern/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="03" label="Feedback" title={`Ideas, <em>bugs</em>, tips.`}>
        <p>Features you miss? Bugs that bother you? Send them to the same address. I read everything and prioritise based on what actually makes the app better.</p>
      </Chapter>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Support`} />
</AppLayout>
